PHP + MySQL backend — simple setup

1. XAMPP install kore Apache ar MySQL start koro (PHP 8.2+).
2. Project folder ta xampp/htdocs/web_project_262 er moddhe rakho.
3. phpMyAdmin theke backend/database.sql import koro.
4. backend/config.php te database name, username, password thik koro.
5. Browser e http://localhost/web_project_262/ open koro.
6. Account register kore login koro.

Purono Node database thakle: backup nao, upgrade.sql ekbar import koro,
tarpor database.sql import koro. Fresh database e upgrade.sql lagbe na.

NEW ADMIN (age register kora lagbe na):
Project root er terminal e run koro:
php backend/create_admin.php

PHP command na pele XAMPP path diye PowerShell e run koro:
& "C:\xampp\php\php.exe" backend/create_admin.php

Name, email, password ar confirm password dao. Tarpor signIn.php diye login koro.
Terminal e password type korar somoy dekha jabe. Database e hash save hobe.
Admin dashboard e login kora thakle "Add New Admin" form use korte paro.

Age register kora account ke admin korte phpMyAdmin e run koro:
UPDATE users SET role = 'admin' WHERE email = 'YOUR-EMAIL';
YOUR-EMAIL er jaygay registered email dao. Eta new account create kore na.

Live Server diye PHP cholbe na. npm/node lagbe na.
Full instructions ar file explanation: project root er README.md.

Code porar order:
config.php -> db.php -> common.php -> register.php -> signIn.php
Tarpor upload.php, Project.php, Community_Forum.php ar admin_index.php.
Main PHP pages project root e ache; helper/database files backend e ache.

Research Explorer er "CSE Papers (Crossref)" option free API theke CSE paper ane.
API key ba database import lagbe na. PHP curl enabled thakte hobe.
"UIU Papers" option e nijeder uploaded/saved papers thakbe.
API code: backend/crossref.php. Result 30 minute backend/cache e cache hoy.

Password reset automatic email pathay na. Admin identity verify kore
30-minute one-time reset link generate kore user ke privately dibe.
